# UI Component Style Guide

## Cards & Boxes
- background: bg_card (#151617)
- border: 1px solid border_soft (#232629)
- border-radius: 12-14px
- hover: bg_card_hover (#1B1D1F)
- active/selected: bg_card_active (#202326) + border_default (#2C3034)
- No colored backgrounds, no glow effects

## Buttons
- Primary: bg #E7E9EC, text #111214, hover #F1F2F4, pressed #D7DBDF, no border
- Secondary: bg bg_card_hover, text text_primary, border border_default
- Ghost: transparent bg, text text_secondary, hover bg #1A1C1E
- Danger: bg danger_bg (#211616), text danger_text (#D68E8E), border #5A2F2F

## Inputs
- background: bg_input (#121314)
- border: border_soft (#232629)
- text: text_primary (#F2F2F2)
- placeholder: text_muted (#8A9097)
- focus: border_strong (#3A3F45) + slight bg lighten, NO blue outline

## Sidebar
- background: bg_panel (#101112)
- item default: transparent
- item hover: bg_card (#151617)
- item active: bg_card_active (#202326) + left indicator #5B6168 + bold text

## Badges/Chips (status colors only)
- Draft/Scheduled/Processing/Paused: neutral gray (neutral_state_bg + neutral_state_text)
- Published: success_bg + success_text + success border
- Failed: danger_bg + danger_text + danger border
- Queued/Retry/Warning: warning_bg + warning_text + warning border

## Progress Bars
- Track: bg_input (#121314), height 4px cards / 6px detail, radius 2px
- Phase 1 (import): border_strong (#3A3F45) fill
- Phase 2 (upload): warning (#9A6B36) fill (orange)
- Complete: success (#4E7F5F) fill (green), smooth 200ms transition
- Failed: danger (#8B4A4A) fill (red)

## Log Panel
- Monospace font, bg_shell (#0B0B0C)
- Timestamps: text_muted
- Status lines colored by state (success/warning/danger/neutral)

## Never Use
- Neon accents, colored focus rings, brand-color CTA buttons
- Colored sidebar navigation, colored tabs without state meaning
- Colored boxes "just to be interesting"
